    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d46-a1">

                <pb facs="0399" n="391" sameAs="frus:frus1902app2/pg391"/>

                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">State of
                            California</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">County of
                                <placeName>Monterey</placeName></hi>,</dateline>
                    <seg>} <hi rendition="#italic">ss:</hi></seg>
                </opener>
                <p>I, J. D. Kalar, county clerk of said Monterey County, and ex officio clerk of the
                    superior court in and for said county, do hereby certify that the foregoing is a
                    full, true, and correct copy of the original proof of the succession of Francis
                    Mora to Thadeus Amat as Roman Catholic bishop of Monterey, a corporation sole,
                    as the same appears of record in my office in Book B, miscellaneous records of
                    Monterey County, California, at page 3 and following.</p>
                <p>And the same has been compared by me with the original.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Witness my hand and seal of said court <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1902-06-13">this 13th day of June, A. D.
                            1902</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>]</seg>
                    <signed rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. D. Kalar</hi>,
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Clerk.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
